Linear workspace

This box serves a copy of the team's Linear data on 127.0.0.1:4570. It is
context: nothing here is graded and nothing in it is a deliverable.

Two ways in, same tools either way:

  linear tools                         list the tools and their arguments
  linear <tool> --name value ...       call one from a shell, e.g.
  linear list_issues --assignee me --limit 10

and, where the harness supports MCP, an MCP server named `linear` offering the
same tools.

public.json is the data being served. Restart with your own copy if you want:

  PYTHONPATH=/opt/mocklinear python3 -m mocklinear --scenario my.json --host 127.0.0.1 --port 4570 --seed 7
